via the International Scholarship. This work has been supported by a Royal Society University Research Fellowship <span id="Sx2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">‘Inclusive and Sustainable Language Technology for a Truly Multilingual World’</span> (no 221137) awarded to Ivan Vulić.</p>
</div>
