<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 7: </span>The number of samples that have each language as a source or target language in for the crosslingual samples and the number of monolingual samples.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A2.F8" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
